     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><br>On Tuesday, November 15, 2016 at 10:41:30 PM UTC+7, Joe Cheng [RStudio] wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">I haven&#39;t dealt with bidi text in years so I had to look it up, maybe this link will help?<br><a href=\"https://www.w3.org/International/articles/inline-bidi-markup/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.w3.org/International/articles/inline-bidi-markup/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792391295037000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0T2sCrLo076Dra7S0KzD4l\">https://www.w3.org/International/articles/inline-bidi-markup/</a><br><br>E.g. tags$span(dir=&quot;rtl&quot;, ...)<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Tue, Nov 15, 2016 at 7:25 AM Imran Ali &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">imran....@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Following is a question that I have already posted on stackoverflow, but have not been able to get an answer. I would appreciate if the group members could help me with it. I am reproducing the question below. Here is the link to <a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/40540783/how-to-properly-concatenate-bidi-strings-in-r\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/40540783/how-to-properly-concatenate-bidi-strings-in-r&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792391295037000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2tTFrDBvRg2PN4PhbAMwQV\">stackoverflow question</a></p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\">I want to add markup to (Urdu language) text that is written right to left. I am trying to use gsub for the purpose but everything I have tried so far does not produce the desired output</p><pre style=\"padding:5px;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(239,240,241);color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">text </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;یہ جملہ ایک مثال کے لیے استعمال کیا جا رہا ہے&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\npattern </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;کیا جا&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\nreplaceWith </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> paste0</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;&lt;somemark&gt;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> pattern</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;&lt;/somemark&gt;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\ngsub</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">pattern</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> replaceWith</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> text</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">)</span></code></pre><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\">gsub returns the following</p><pre style=\"padding:5px;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(239,240,241);color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">یہ جملہ ایک مثال کے لیے استعمال </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">somemark</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">کیا جا</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">somemark</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> رہا ہے</span></code></pre><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\">desired output .</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://i.stack.imgur.com/Q4RUB.png\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(0,89,153)\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://i.stack.imgur.com/Q4RUB.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792391295037000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2XOZJzsSWBvQOkzsix_1Bn\"><img src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/APBwa79p1JwxK-_4KAjKcvUKiDioSJBPcv6N5C2E0RL1_2hM921Kdg6AqGlfaGgVGbUVqQ6R=w5000-h5000\" alt=\"enter image description here\" style=\"max-width:100%\"></a></p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\">How can I acheive the desired output?</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong>Note:</strong> I could not even properly typeset the desired output in my post, I had to rely on an image instead.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong>Update:</strong> Although <code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-size:13px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(239,240,241);white-space:pre-wrap\">mysub</code> function below correctly concatenates the strings(in console), I continue to face the problem of incorrect order of text in shiny app.</p><pre style=\"padding:5px;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(239,240,241);color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">mysub </span>